        {
          "@value": "Spreadsheet tabular metadata (STUB)"
        }
      ],
      "skos:definition": [
        {
          "@value": "STUB — not implemented. Would read a workbook into a CSVW TableGroup: one table per sheet, with the location CSVW cannot express (`fac:anchor`, `fac:headerRow`, `fac:extent`) carried as annotations on valid CSVW. A workbook is the case that motivates those terms: tables that do not start at A1, headers that are not row 1, several tables on one sheet."
        }
